Spec: .NET independent server lease validation

Purpose:
  Enforce standard signed server authority at an Agent using current trusted control state.

Owns:
  ./ServerLease.cs

Must:
  Verify mature ES256 JWS/JWT signing, issuer, audience, type and lifetime in addition to strict exact JSON and generation matching.
  Validate the owner-root device certificate profile and pin the expected issuer SPKI without system trust changes or token-supplied keys.
  Bind receipt lifetime to the earlier of signed expiry and issuer/root certificate expiry using a held time provider.
  Preserve the first monotonic deadline for replay, reject old sequences and permanently close a stopped control generation.
